{"parse": {"title": "宇宙玻片", "pageid": 100450, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"宇宙玻片\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/22/CurrencyItem-2701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"宇宙玻片\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>宇宙玻片</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-2701 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyIcon-2701_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-2701_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyIcon-2701_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-2701_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/CurrencyIcon-2701_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-2701_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>2#2701</div></div><hr /><div>自无垠处寄往渺小星球的一封信，作为“远方”存在的证明，被珍重地收藏在此。可用于特别柜台兑换。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">遥远的星群寻索着注目它们的眼睛。在一无所有的暗处，人群辨识出那片光晕，永恒的河流尽头才亮起了仙后座星云。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "宇宙玻片"}}